<title>USA: Clark joins Smith Barney as investment banker.</title>
<headline>Clark joins Smith Barney as investment banker.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Travelers Group Inc's Smith Barney unit said John Clark has joined the firm's investment banking division as a director in the financial institutions group.</p>
<p>Clark joined Smith Barney from UBS Securities, where he was most recently a managing director in its financial institutions group.</p>
<p>UBS is a unit of Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
